! Exercise 2 (intended mistake): all three network statements look alike in the config,
! so all three are retired -- including 10.20.20.0/24, the live service prefix.
router bgp 65004
   address-family ipv4
      no network 10.20.20.0/24
      no network 10.20.30.0/24
      no network 10.20.40.0/24
